direction: right

Don: Don (operator)
Zo: Zo Computer {
  Zorro: Zorro persona (memory + token rules baked in)
  ZorroSkill: Zorro skill scripts/zorro.ts
  Memory: 3-layer memory
  Clarion: Clarion markdown tree
  Zobodhi: zobodhi-memory memory.json
  Astra: DataStax AstraDB (67 memories)
  TokenSaver: token-saver v2.6.3 (32 processors)
  Provider: Zo AI provider (BYOK)
  Proxy: ollama-proxy :11435
  Ollama: Ollama local qwen3:14b (primary) + gemma3 :11434
  FreeCloud: Free tiers (Gemini flash, ViroScope)
}

Don -> Zo: chat
Zorro -> ZorroSkill: task / memory / remember / plan
ZorroSkill -> Memory: query + remember
Clarion -> Memory: memory/**
Zobodhi -> Memory: memory.json facts
Memory -> Astra: sync.ts + nomic-embed (768d)
Astra -> ZorroSkill: hybrid RRF results
Zorro -> TokenSaver: wrap verbose bash
Zorro -> Provider: model calls
Provider -> Proxy: OpenAI-compatible /v1
Proxy -> Ollama: stream=false, tools stripped
Zorro -> FreeCloud: no-key / free-tier APIs
